 "discovery_notes": "B428 follow-up 12 of B044 (DLP 2020-2021). New: Parisian Minnie three (dein-dlrp Sep 2020 line items), small world facade and Goofy gondolier (dein-dlrp Aug 2021) plus C&D Tower Bridge set (held), Cinderella OE Lucifer and Mickey Cowboy (rp84 per-pin pages; cowboy held as possible sheriff duplicate), RotJ poster pin (Disneyphile). Child set for Christmas 2021 C&D pin set. No holds released. New source dlp.rp84.fr. Snippet-only evidence."
